## Hints

- E1: at very small h, f(x+h) − f(x) cancels to zero in floating point;
  at large h you measure a chord. The sweet spot is 1e-4..1e-6.
- E2: dW/dr_k = product of all growth factors AFTER day k.
- E4: 0.8×1.25 = 1.0; 1.25×0.8 = 1.0 — hmm, compute carefully: which pairs
  give exactly 1, and which give less? Try −20%/+20% and −33%/+50%.
